      en: ["Located in the North Kurzeme Upland of western Latvia.", "The approximate elevation is 64 meters above sea level.", "Formed at the end of the last Ice Age about 12,000 years ago.", "Geologically composed of glacial moraine deposits.", "The surrounding vegetation is dominated by dense coniferous forests.", "Serves as a natural drainage divide for local stream systems."],
